WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:03.870
A weekend of

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:06.206
chaos and drama in Russia.

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:11.011
With mercenaries declared a mutiny

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.278
and then called it off.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.614
In under 24 hours.

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:16.249
Why then would see that

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:17.450
Yevgeny Prigozhin

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.652
issued a call for rebellion.

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.821
The head of the Wagner mercenary group

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:22.589
accusing

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:23.223
top Russian

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:24.324
military commanders

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:25.892
of gross mismanagement

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:29.462
of the war in Ukraine.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:31.664
Then Prigozhin released

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.900
video of an alleged Russian airstrike

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.835
on a Wagner camp in Ukraine

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.470
demanding revenge.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.805
Russia's defense ministry

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:40.306
denied the attack,

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:41.474
and soon Russia's top

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:42.909
prosecutor announced

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:45.345
criminal charges against Prigozhin

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:48.915
Then in the early hours

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:50.250
of Saturday, Prigozhin

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.118
followed through on his threats,

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:53.086
sending his fighters

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:54.087
across the border

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:56.589
from Ukraine back into Russia.

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:57.290
Footage

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:58.725
surfaced at dawn showing

00:00:58.725 --> 00:00:59.692
Wagner fighters

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:01.795
surrounding the military headquarters

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:04.731
in the southern Russian city of Rostov on

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:07.967
Some locals

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:11.271
stood nearby watching some U.S..

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:13.306
At around 7:30 a.m.

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:14.040
Prigozhin was

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:14.941
then shown

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:15.875
dressing down

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:16.743
senior Russian

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:19.479
military leaders and issuing demands.

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:22.615
This would appear again.

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:23.750
We came here.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.318
We want to receive the chief

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:27.620
of general staff and sugar

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.556
until they show up until they show up.

00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:30.924
We are located here

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:32.826
blockading the city of Rostov

00:01:32.826 --> 00:01:34.461
and will go to Moscow.

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:34.694
The

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:38.565
video showed columns of Wagner troops

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:40.700
heading north towards the capital

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:41.501
along the way,

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:42.702
claiming control

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:44.370
of military installations

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:47.273
in the Voronezh region.

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:50.043
Footage later showed at least one

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:51.544
Russian helicopter

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:54.981
narrowly avoiding a missile collision.

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:56.950
So was wrong with you?

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:57.717
At 10 a.m.

00:01:57.717 --> 00:01:58.818
Moscow time, Russian

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:00.153
President Vladimir Putin

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:02.222
made a televised address to the nation,

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:05.191
calling the rebellion a stab in the back.

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:06.860
All those who deliberately

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:08.394
chose the path of treachery,

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:10.063
who prepared an armed mutiny,

00:02:10.063 --> 00:02:11.664
who chose the path of blackmail

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:13.233
and terrorist methods will face

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:14.534
inevitable punishment

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:15.602
and will answer both to the

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:16.970
law and to our people.

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:20.640
The Kremlin announced counterterrorism

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.109
measures, tightening security in Moscow,

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:26.212
but by Saturday night,

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:28.381
suddenly a Kremlin reversal.

00:02:28.615 --> 00:02:31.718
Putin's spokesman announced a deal by it.

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:32.752
The more we knew,

00:02:32.752 --> 00:02:34.521
Meier Prigozhin released

00:02:34.521 --> 00:02:35.855
an audio message saying

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:37.457
his troops would turn around

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:39.392
and go back to field camps

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:41.461
to avoid shedding Russian blood.

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:43.096
While

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:45.765
their supporters chanted

00:02:45.765 --> 00:02:48.568
Wagner as fighters drove out of Rostov,

00:02:48.902 --> 00:02:49.802
giving Prigozhin

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:52.472
handshakes as he left in this SUV.

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:54.641
The Kremlin says it's dropped

00:02:54.641 --> 00:02:57.510
charges, and Prigozhin will go to Belarus

00:02:57.777 --> 00:02:59.913
while promising his fighters contracts

00:02:59.913 --> 00:03:01.648
with the Russian military.

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:04.217
For now, a crisis apparently averted.

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:06.686
But this very public betrayal

00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:07.987
and the mercenary short

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:11.257
but unimpeded March on Moscow reveals

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:12.559
deep weakness

00:03:12.559 --> 00:03:14.894
at the heart of the Putin regime.

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:16.429
Ivan Watson, CNN.

